# Weapons
item.tconspartan.dagger.name=Dagger
item.tconspartan.dagger.desc=A short, quick blade that strikes three times harder from behind.\nHold right-click to throw it.
item.tconspartan.parrying_dagger.name=Parrying Dagger
item.tconspartan.parrying_dagger.desc=An off-hand blade made to turn aside blows.\nHold right-click to parry melee attacks.
item.tconspartan.katana.name=Katana
item.tconspartan.katana.desc=A swift curved sword that sweeps through crowds and bites deep into unarmoured foes.\nBest wielded with both hands.
item.tconspartan.saber.name=Saber
item.tconspartan.saber.desc=A cavalry sword with a sweeping strike.\nHolding it absorbs part of the melee damage you take.
item.tconspartan.spear.name=Spear
item.tconspartan.spear.desc=A simple, reliable polearm that keeps enemies at arm's length.
item.tconspartan.mace.name=Flanged Mace
item.tconspartan.mace.desc=A flanged club that cracks bones.\nEspecially effective against the undead.
item.tconspartan.quarterstaff.name=Quarterstaff
item.tconspartan.quarterstaff.desc=A fast two-handed staff that sweeps around you.\nThe head material caps the top end, the binding the bottom end.
item.tconspartan.throwing_knife.name=Throwing Knife
item.tconspartan.throwing_knife.desc=A stack of balanced knives: their number depends on the materials.\nHold right-click and release to throw one.
item.tconspartan.throwing_axe.name=Throwing Axe
item.tconspartan.throwing_axe.desc=A stack of heavy throwing axes: their number depends on the materials.\nHold right-click and release to throw one.
item.tconspartan.javelin.name=Javelin
item.tconspartan.javelin.desc=A bundle of javelins that deal heavy damage when thrown.\nHold right-click and release to throw one.
item.tconspartan.boomerang.name=Boomerang
item.tconspartan.boomerang.desc=Hold right-click and release to throw it:\nit flies back to you after hitting something.
item.tconspartan.pike.name=Pike
item.tconspartan.pike.desc=A very long spear held with both hands.\nHits from further away than any other weapon.
item.tconspartan.lance.name=Lance
item.tconspartan.lance.desc=A knightly weapon with extended reach.\nDeals double damage while riding.
item.tconspartan.glaive.name=Glaive
item.tconspartan.glaive.desc=A bladed polearm with extended reach.\nIts sweep deals half damage around the target.
item.tconspartan.greatsword.name=Greatsword
item.tconspartan.greatsword.desc=A massive two-handed sword.\nIts sweep deals full damage to everything around the target.
item.tconspartan.halberd.name=Halberd
item.tconspartan.halberd.desc=A heavy polearm with extended reach.\nIts blows disable shields.
item.tconspartan.battle_axe.name=Battleaxe
item.tconspartan.battle_axe.desc=A heavy double-bitted axe.\nA weapon first, but it also chops wood.
item.tconspartan.warhammer.name=Warhammer
item.tconspartan.warhammer.desc=Its spike punches through plate.\nHalf of the damage ignores armour.
item.tconspartan.battle_hammer.name=Battle Hammer
item.tconspartan.battle_hammer.desc=A slow, crushing hammer.\nKnocks enemies back and leaves them dazed.
item.tconspartan.war_scythe.name=War Scythe
item.tconspartan.war_scythe.desc=A reaping weapon with a wide sweep.\nHits harder against foes without a helmet.

